JOHN DEANE OF NOTTINGHAM; 
his Adventures and Exploits
.  By W. H. G. KINGSTON. With Illustrations. Post 8vo, price 5s.  cloth elegant.

FROM PEASANT TO PRINCE; 
or, the Life of Alexander Prince Menschikoff
.  Freely translated from the Russian by Madame Pietzker. With Illustrations. Fcap. 8vo, 2s.  6d.  cloth; 3s.  gilt edges.

ROSAMOND FANE; 
or, The Prisoners of St. James
.  By M. & C. LEE. Illustrations by Robert Dudley. Post 8vo, price 3s.  6d.  cloth elegant; 4s.  gilt edges.

NEPTUNE; 
or, The Autobiography of a Newfoundland Dog
.  By the Author of "Tuppy," etc. With Illustrations by Elwes. Super-royal 16mo, price 2s.  6d.  cloth; 3s.  6d.  coloured, gilt edges.
